# HuggingFace API Token for Speaker Diarization
# 
# To enable speaker diarization features, you need a HuggingFace access token:
#
# 1. Go to https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens
# 2. Create a new token with READ access
# 3. Accept user conditions at:
#    - https://huggingface.co/pyannote/segmentation-3.0
#    - https://huggingface.co/pyannote/speaker-diarization-3.1
# 4. Copy this file to .env and add your token below
#
# HUGGINGFACE_TOKEN=your_read_access_token_here

# Uncomment and set your token:
# HUGGINGFACE_TOKEN=hf_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx